<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Goa cargoes - Feb 11.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Goa cargoes - Feb 11.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Marmagao port on February 11:</p>
<p> Commodity		Tons		   Ship	    Berthing</p>
<p>		    (LDD/ULD)(Balance)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
